          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "code": {
          "text": "History of childhood vesicoureteral reflux with recurrent UTIs and two pyelonephritis admissions; no episodes since approximately age 15; currently asymptomatic, renal status unknown"
        }
      }
    },
    {
